{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-55","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：二项无理线段与中项无理线段与无理线段","englishTitle":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and the second binomial, the side of the area is the irrational straight line which is called a first bimedial.","book":10,"number":55,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.55","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.55/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":55,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","contentId":"euclid-10-55","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e25e28e6cd6da2e5ab1e06b2dda8cb3acf1607b835f353b422ed87670c7320ab","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-55.statement","euclid-10-55.construction.1","euclid-10-55.proof.1","euclid-10-55.construction.2","euclid-10-55.proof.2","euclid-10-55.construction.3","euclid-10-55.proof.3","euclid-10-55.proof.4","euclid-10-55.proof.5","euclid-10-55.proof.6","euclid-10-55.proof.7","euclid-10-55.proof.8","euclid-10-55.proof.9","euclid-10-55.proof.10","euclid-10-55.proof.11","euclid-10-55.proof.12","euclid-10-55.proof.13","euclid-10-55.proof.14","euclid-10-55.proof.15","euclid-10-55.proof.16","euclid-10-55.proof.17","euclid-10-55.conclusion","euclid-10-55.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-55.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e45364174faecd9e653fc204818ea57c7e5c3072ee8b0b1a17c1bc3b5f24d8f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and the second binomial, the side of the area is the irrational straight line which is called a first bimedial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个区域由有理线段和第二个二项无理线段组成,则区域的另一边是无理线段,即第一个双中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed863eea6b47c94fc878149dfee84a85b63e955f41a5cde440e00ba8c50e5a27","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the area ABCD be contained by the rational straight line AB and the second binomial AD; I say that the side of the area AC is a first bimedial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ABCD区由有理线段 AB和第二个二项无理线段 AD组成;我说,AC区一侧是第一个双中项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a920bd551648f05e44f930012244894503d4237502d398470a083451e3e8d12b","citations":["euclid-10-def-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AD is a second binomial straight line, let it be divided into its terms at E, so that AE is the greater term; therefore AE, ED are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, the square on AE is greater than the square on ED by the square on a straight line commensurable with AE, and the lesser term ED is commensurable in length with AB. [[X. Deff. II. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AD是第二二项无理线段直线,所以将其分为E,AE是较大期限;因此,AE、ED是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,AE是正方形,比ED正方形的正方形多,比可公度的长度可公度和AE的正方形大,较轻期限是ED,比AB大。 [[X. Deff. II. 2](/principles/euclid-10-def-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f44966ea493e4d09a1cb7410f240ca135b0c3ad2071acd9e8f15ce335f1084b","citations":["euclid-10-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ED be bisected at F, and let there be applied to AE the rectangle AG, GE equal to the square on EF and deficient by a square figure; therefore AG is commensurable in length with GE. [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ED两部分为F,GE矩形、AGGEAEAEEFEF正方形,有正方形数字不足;因此,AG长度可公度和GEEDAE。 [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"287dfd9799629b67f8786369ccb6a85cd6ea63e53207b4a645c20a8a04edb828","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Through G, E, F let GH, EK, FL be drawn parallel to AB, CD, let the square SN be constructed equal to the parallelogram AH, and the square NQ equal to GK, and let them be placed so that MN is in a straight line with NO; therefore RN is also in a straight line with NP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"通过G、E、F、GH、EK、FL工程,与AB、CD工程平行,使正方形、SN工程相当于平行四边形、AH和正方形、NQ工程等于GK工程,并把它们放置在MN直线上,NO直线上,RN直线上,NP直线上。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"177591518702c95466421364bbe43d1287482a2751f6131af84fd37ca65f386c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the square SQ be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"完成正方形 SQ"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7bb7ec343c7fa96ffefe7790378016ed6eb616f441aa61b7a496d35ce5faecd3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is then manifest from what was proved before that MR is a mean proportional between SN, NQ and is equal to EL, and that MO is the side of the area AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从以前证明的情况可以看出,MR是SN、NQ之间的比例中项,等于EL,MO是AC地区的一侧。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f7fa931bd79d3b48fcac59e25a981a7421da5db0b4044b91ef1e06e73fcfe81","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is now to be proved that MO is a first bimedial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在可以证明,MO是第一个双中项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"19b4328728da9bcc28345bdd939e7753a442a36a29ec5eff80dd0eeb4ba38201","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since AE is incommensurable in length with ED, while ED is commensurable with AB, therefore AE is incommensurable with AB. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AE长不可公度,ED长可公度,AB长可公度,AE长不可公度,AB长AE。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ea403aa66719b3e3fb6a810b9d7f3bc76b8052b16751e86f6df8f22e39dab12","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AG is commensurable with EG, AE is also commensurable with each of the straight lines AG, GE. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG是可公度,EG,AE也是可公度,每条直线AG,GE。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0572098b6365250afc9b7d76d66987c2981ccfeb477115c57548c9548b267e5c","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AE is incommensurable in length with AB; therefore AG, GE are also incommensurable with AB. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AE的长度是不可公度,AB,AG,GE,不可公度,AB。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85e5369bc260af487cc2a20200489742b350a087f74dbcdd7a01d814a821620c","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BA, AG and BA, GE are pairs of rational straight lines commensurable in square only; so that each of the rectangles AH, GK is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BA、AG和BA、GE是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度对;因此,矩形 AH、GK对各为中项无理线段对。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c95bb5317b09a982b74c061975e4e37f096b722a03afd9aaf81c0aa377a4106","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence each of the squares SN, NQ is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,正方形 SN,NQ中,每个都是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fefd412305b6a1175776e81697fa1808b9b330fedf8b72fe54893d60d9eafd30","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore MN, NO are also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,MN,NO也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8038e511584c97cffe97e78345a37eb27016ca63d5696ee38c12d67e1b15e8d5","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AG is commensurable in length with GE, AH is also commensurable with GK, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1). [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)] that is, SN is commensurable with NQ, that is, the square on MN with the square on NO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AG是长度可公度,GE,AH也是可公度,GK, 也就是说,SN是可公度,NQ,即MN是正方形,NO是正方形。 [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5a46e8b2295ae33ad7e51910b9137e857e38270788a155e2096fcab06cb3b2d","citations":["euclid-10-13","euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AE is incommensurable in length with ED, while AE is commensurable with AG, and ED is commensurable with EF, therefore AG is incommensurable with EF; [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] so that AH is also incommensurable with EL, that is, SN is incommensurable with MR, that is, PN with NR, [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)] that is, MN is incommensurable in length with NO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE是不可公度,ED是AG,ED是可公度,EF是不可公度,EF是不可公度,EF是EF,AH也是不可公度,EL,SN是不可公度,MR,PN是NR,MN是不可公度,NO。  [ [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)] [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4fe53a4674b1485477864dda9c1f6f17144387402ccc446409f4c983cdef6319","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But MN, NO were proved to be both medial and commensurable in square; therefore MN, NO are medial straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但正方形,MN、NO被证明为中项无理线段和可公度;因此,MN、NO被证明为中项无理线段、平方可公度而长度不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6c9e45fb523ec83cc96046d001c3f9db24a63b4105959f0b8fe16c4fba65936a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that they also contain a rational rectangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,它们也包含有理 矩形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"067676c9fb770807b62ece755a90dc06e113703655a2cb091b65d43295758e23","citations":["euclid-10-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since DE is, by hypothesis, commensurable with each of the straight lines AB, EF, therefore EF is also commensurable with EK. [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为假设DE是可公度,每条直线AB,EF,因此EF也与EK。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"140c71ac25ad1861715fd7524b26190454e6b10c9e410d08084c7a6e39fb3c37","citations":["euclid-10-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And each of them is rational; therefore EL, that is, MR is rational, [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)] and MR is the rectangle MN, NO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每一个是有理, 因此EL, 即MR,有理,MR,矩形,MN,NO。 [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"179144aca4ec77742c99a4029d495c95cf466f86b2c4dfefe685e78926879e95","citations":["euclid-10-37"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if two medial straight lines commensurable in square only and containing a rational rectangle be added together, the whole is irrational and is called a first bimedial straight line. [[X. 37](/principles/euclid-10-37)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果将两个中项无理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度和有理 矩形加在一起,整个是无理,称为第一个双中项无理线段直线。 [[X. 37](/principles/euclid-10-37)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":21,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"980350e62725e66327e3dcd0bf20e5f0cc7bba7b7579a657a972cd3e36462721","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore MO is a first bimedial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,MO是第一个双中项无理线段直线,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-55.source","contentId":"euclid-10-55","revisionId":"euclid-10-55@raw-e25e28e6cd6da2e5","order":22,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ce26f029da8135d34516f2da45f9e7c0f913003ea14436ae6dd424497f17372","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg17